sequence46	MetaGeneAnnotator	CDS	6186	6500	.	-	0	ID=MGA_3713;product=BrnA antitoxin family protein;inference=COORDINATES:ab initio prediction:MetaGeneAnnotator,similar to AA sequence:RefSeq:WP_000063142.1;translation=MSMVRYSHKELNEKFGEKQDAEIQRLLAKGTVPDDQLDLSDIPEITDWSNAVRQNQFYRPVKQQTSIRLDADVLAWFKAQGKGYQTRMNEILRDAMLKELKNHQ;locus_tag=LOCUS_36710;note=WP_000063142.1 BrnA antitoxin family protein (Salmonella) [pid:51.0%25%2C q_cov:95.2%25%2C s_cov:96.0%25%2C Eval:1.4e-18],Domain:cl23863:BrnA_antitoxin BrnA antitoxin of type II toxin-antitoxin system. CopG antitoxin is a member of a type II toxin-antitoxin system family found in bacteria and archaea. Most antitoxins encoded by the relBE and parDE loci belong to the MetJ/Arc/CopG family of dimeric proteins which bind DNA through N-terminal ribbon-helix-helix (RHH) motifs. The toxin for CopG proteins falls into the family BrnT_toxin%2C pfam04365. [Superfamily%2C Aligned:3-99%2C Eval:3.6e-19%2C score:72.5],MGA_3713
sequence46	MetaGeneAnnotator	CDS	6487	6774	.	-	0	ID=MGA_3714;product=BrnT family toxin;inference=COORDINATES:ab initio prediction:MetaGeneAnnotator,similar to AA sequence:RefSeq:WP_001131963.1;translation=MEQYFEWDEAKNRKNQKKHDISFETASLVFEDPLRISIQDRHTNGEERWQTIGRVKGVLMLLVAHTIFDEDDCEIIRIISARQVTKAERNKYEHG;locus_tag=LOCUS_36720;note=WP_001131963.1 BrnT family toxin (Salmonella) [pid:52.6%25%2C q_cov:100.0%25%2C s_cov:100.0%25%2C Eval:2.8e-24],Domain:cl01108:BrnT_toxin Ribonuclease toxin%2C BrnT%2C of type II toxin-antitoxin system. BrnT is a ribonuclease toxin of a type II toxin-antitoxin system that exhibits a RelE-like fold. The antitoxin that neutralizes this toxin is pfam14384. BrnT is found in bacteria%2C archaea%2C bacteriophage%2C and plasmids. BrnT-BrnA forms a 2:2 tetrameric complex and autoregulates its own expression%2C which is induced by a number of different environmental stresses. Expression of BrnT alone results in cessation of bacterial growth which can be rescued after subsequent expression of BrnA. [Superfamily%2C Aligned:5-95%2C Eval:5.9e-29%2C score:97.1],MGA_3714
